        "Content": "1. Bespoke Glenline oak kitchen with black granite worktops\r\n2. Rangemaster cooker\r\n3. White marble entrance hall flooring and solid oak flooring throughout the main living areas\r\n4. Oil fired condensing boiler with ground and first floor underfloor heating, individual room heating controls and wireless EPH thermostats\r\n5. Glass fibre tanking waterproofed showers\r\n6. Water filtration, softening and UV treatment system\r\n7. Own private well with submersible pump and EPS Bison Unit.\r\n8. Ducon first floor slab and main stairs\r\n9. Sorpetaler German made alu clad tilt and turn double glazed windows.\r\n10. Eir Fibre broadband - 500mb"
